  "question": {
    "text": "A particle executes simple harmonic motion with an amplitude of <math><mn>5</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>m</mi></math> . When the particle is at <math><mn>4</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>m</mi></math> from the mean position, the magnitude of its velocity in <math><mi>S</mi><mi>I</mi></math> units is equal to that of its acceleration. Then, its periodic time in seconds is:"
